I happen to know of a decent quiz/flash card Mac program called  
Kurisu. http://www.frykholm.se/kurisu.html  It's meant to help with  
Japanese, judging by the name and the quizzes it comes with, but you  
can make your own quizzes/stacks of flash cards. So, with a little  
bit of work, it could easily be a lojban flash card program.

All I want to know now is why I didn't think of that myself.

